; NCREC RED4ext — optional render-only fullscreen preview
; Copy/rename this file to NCREC.ini in red4ext/plugins/NCREC/
; Requires Cyberpunk 2.50 and a game-compatible RED4ext loader.
;
; WARNING: This still hooks DirectX. Test only at the main menu or pause
; screen. The fullscreen preview is NOT INTERACTIVE. F8 toggles it by default.
; CET can keep its separate F10 binding.
; To choose another one-key binding, edit ToggleKey below.
; Supported: F6, F7, F8, F9, F10, F11, F12,
; Insert, Home, End, PageUp, PageDown.
; NCREC deliberately does not capture mouse/keyboard or pause the game.
; To recover, delete/rename NCREC.ini or set PassiveFullscreen=0.
[Experimental]
PassiveFullscreen=1
ToggleKey=F8
